{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"十年春王二月，邾子益來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"公會吳伐齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"三月戊戌，齊侯陽生卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"夏，宋人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"晉趙鞅帥師侵齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"五月，公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"葬齊悼公。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"衛公孟彄自齊歸于衛。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"薛伯夷卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"秋，葬薛惠公。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"冬，楚公子結帥師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"吳救陳。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"十年春，邾隱公來奔。齊甥也，故遂奔齊。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"公會吳子、邾子、郯子伐齊南鄙，師于鄎。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"齊人弒悼公，赴于師。吳子三日哭于軍門之外。徐承帥舟師將自海入齊，齊人敗之，吳師乃還。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"夏，趙鞅帥師伐齊，大夫請卜之。趙孟曰：「吾卜於此起兵，事不再令，卜不襲吉，行也。」於是乎取犁及轅，毀高唐之郭，侵及賴而還。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"秋，吳子使來復儆師。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_238_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_238","textTraditional":"冬，楚子期伐陳，吳延州來季子救陳，謂子期曰：「二君不務德，而力爭諸侯，民何罪焉？我請退，以為子名，務德而安民。」乃還。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}